OL,5,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FFiona and her son James roll out
OL,7,     Fthe red carpet for their rivals,
OL,8,     Fat The Derby Manor Hotel and
OL,9,     FRestaurant. Will over 6000
OL,10,     Fhand-glued diamante studs on the
OL,11,     Fwalls dazzle their guests?
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time to find out how
OL,16,     Fmuch they've been paid and to
OL,17,     Fsettle some scores, before the
OL,18,     Fwinner is announced.
