OL,5,G1850 The Dog House Australia
OL,6,     FThe team at picturesque doggy
OL,7,     Fsanctuary Animal Welfare League
OL,8,     FNSW hope that neo-mastiff cross
OL,9,     FGoober's drool won't be too much
OL,10,     Ffor Scott and Adelaide.
OL,11,G1955 The Dog House
OL,12,     FIt's double trouble for the
OL,13,     FBodleys, as cockapoo twins Milo
OL,14,     Fand Mabel burst into the pen. Can
OL,15,     Fcanine and family energy levels
OL,16,     Fmatch? And Floyd the stray lurcher
OL,17,     Fneeds a good feed.
